        "title": "尽量 + action",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "尽量 asks someone to do as much as practical within their limits. It differs from an unconditional promise to achieve the result.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我尽量帮助你。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ jǐnliàng bāngzhù nǐ 。",
                "meaning": "I will help you as much as I can.",
                "audio": "be12de7aeb9b9f5a84b63fe784b370bf6bf6224eb585ad9c45641841ac2b6d5e"
              },
              {
                "text": "请尽量早点儿来。",
                "pinyin": "qǐng jǐnliàng zǎo diǎnr lái 。",
                "meaning": "Please come as early as you can.",
